%%{init: {"theme": "base", "flowchart": {"htmlLabels": false}}}%%
flowchart TD
    ROOT(["SGWPlayer.def\nparse entry — EntityDescription_Parse"])

    ROOT --> P1
    P1["① &lt;Parent&gt; recursion\nresolve SGWBeing.def first"]
    P1 --> SGWBEING_TREE
    SGWBEING_TREE["SGWBeing.def\n(recurses to SGWSpawnableEntity → SGWEntity)\nyields: propID 0..M, methodID 0..26"]

    SGWBEING_TREE --> P2
    P2["② &lt;Implements&gt; — 11 interfaces in XML order\nrecursively loaded via EntityDescription_ParseImplements"]
    P2 --> IFLIST
    IFLIST["Communicator → OrganizationMember →\nMinigamePlayer → GateTravel →\nSGWInventoryManager → SGWMailManager →\nMissionary → ContactListManager →\nSGWBlackMarketManager → ClientCache →\nSGWPoller\nappends propID + methodID counters"]

    IFLIST --> P3
    P3["③ Own sections — EntityDescription_ParseDef\nin fixed order"]

    P3 --> PROPS
    P3 --> CMETH
    P3 --> CELLMETH
    P3 --> BASEMETH

    PROPS["&lt;Properties&gt;\nEntityDescription_ParseProperties\npropID +=, filtered to client bits 0x06"]
    CMETH["&lt;ClientMethods&gt;\nEntityDescription_ParseClientMethods\nclient methodID 98..156"]
    CELLMETH["&lt;CellMethods&gt;\nEntityDescription_ParseCellMethods\ncell methodID += (Exposed only)"]
    BASEMETH["&lt;BaseMethods&gt;\nEntityDescription_ParseBaseMethods\nbase methodID += (Exposed only)"]

    PROPS --> ACCUM
    CMETH --> ACCUM
    CELLMETH --> ACCUM
    BASEMETH --> ACCUM
    ACCUM["IDs accumulate left-to-right across the tree:\nparent's last propID + 1 = next contributor's first propID;\nsame for cell-methodID, base-methodID, client-methodID.\nSGWPlayer totals: 157 client methods, indices 0..156."]

    style ROOT fill:#e8f4fb,stroke:#5599cc
    style P1 fill:#ddeeff,stroke:#5599cc
    style P2 fill:#fff4d6,stroke:#cc9933
    style P3 fill:#ddffdd,stroke:#5fb15f
    style PROPS fill:#fff7e6
    style CMETH fill:#ffeedd
    style CELLMETH fill:#ffeedd
    style BASEMETH fill:#ffeedd
    style ACCUM fill:#f4f4f4,stroke:#666
    style SGWBEING_TREE fill:#e8f4fb
    style IFLIST fill:#fff4d6
